<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sorcerers Guild</h1>
<p>The sorcerers, who give their whole lives to mastering the magic of the 
world, keep their guild in a tower in Midgaard, behind a door on the 
city's streets. Its head is Phoebius the Master Sorcerer.
</p><p>To join, stand before Phoebius and type <a cmd='#'>join</a>. Followers of the faith 
can't master the science of magic: healers, druids, necromancers, 
paladins, dark knights and rangers are turned away. First you must prove 
yourself worthy by finishing the Sorcerer's Guild quest; Phoebius sends 
you to Master Forbin to begin it. To leave the guild, insult the Master; 
but a member who is banished can never come back.
</p><p>A conjurer who has joined, and has never specialized, can ask Phoebius to 
become a sorcerer: say "specialize" to him, and drink the red ale he 
gives you. The change is permanent (see <a cmd='#'>Help Sorcerer</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
